    reminderText: "Once per card on first Bait attachment, grant one independent pending recovery. The next technique played with an attached Armored creature selected as a target consumes the oldest recovery. Check eligibility at play time. After the technique and every triggered effect finish, return that exact played discard occurrence, even if the target left. If full, optionally discard one hand technique or decline. No selected target and Hooked-only targeting do not qualify. Source removal or mode changes do not cancel the grant. A declined recovery or missing played occurrence still consumes it and never substitutes another copy. One recovery per qualifying play; multiple grants cover consecutive plays."
